    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello our Mates! Welcome to the Boardgame World\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the ultimate gaming experience with Table Party! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring your friends and family together for laughter and fun, or play solo with our engaging AI. Dive into a growing collection of tabletop and casual games, all set in beautifully detailed interactive environments. Enjoy friendly competition, share unforgettable moments, and let the good times roll!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Games include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Yacht Dice \ud83c\udfb2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Othello \u26aa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Chess \u265f\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Checkers \u26ab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rummy \u2666\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Gin Rummy \u2663\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Yut Nori \ud83e\udd62</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Omok \u26aa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Janggi \ud83c\udc04</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- One card \u2660\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stack Up \ud83d\udce6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Flying Arrow \ud83c\udfaf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Whack a Mole \ud83d\udd28</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Catch the Ghost \ud83d\udc7b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Matgo \ud83c\udfb4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Play solo against AI, or join a room with up to 4 human players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Create a party or use quick match to find online players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Meta avatar support: Show off your unique style with your personalized avatar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Win and record high scores on the global leader board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Explore and relax in a variety of different locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Community Room: Up to 8 players can gather to organize games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Discover interactive extras such as Darts and Basketball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 Latest Update!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-  community room :\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're constantly working to make Table Party the best place to hang out and have fun with friends in VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have some exciting updates in the pipeline including more games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect with the world for a fun competition!<br>Enjoy your play\u2728</p>",
