unity Room: Up to 8 players can gather to organize games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Discover interactive extras such as Darts and Basketball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 Latest Update!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-  community room :\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're constantly working to make Table Party the best place to hang out and have fun with friends in VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have some exciting updates in the pipeline including more games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect with the world for a fun competition!<br>Enjoy your play\u2728</p>",
    "short_description": "Hello our Mates! Welcome to the Boardgame World\u2728 Connect with the world for a fun competition! \ud835\udde7\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddef\ud835\uddf9\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\udde3\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddff\ud835\ude01\ud835\ude06 is an ultimate VR board game that recreates the classic charm of board games in a more immersive way in virtual reality. Play with your friends and family and enjoy a fun game night.",
